**Simplifying menu design**

I need to work on simplifying the _FileBlockActionMenu. Since the file card has a PopupMenuButton labeled "附件操作" with many items, including move, I’m thinking about folding complex options and possibly avoiding nested submenus. It's worth noting that PopupMenuButton can't have nested menus. P006 suggests that complex or low-frequency options should be folded into "更多类二级入口." So I aim to streamline it for better functionality and user experience!
