**Identifying test issues**

I see a potential issue with the code snippet `await tester.tap(find.text(label));` if there are duplicate labels in the "More" section. The localized test might end up finding widgets due to the tooltip not being visible as text. The tooltips could be represented as `Tooltip.message`, not actual text. I might also need to check if the tests expect a certain number of vertical dividers and update the functionality to ensure it accounts for keyboard focus on labels. I'll look around line 2298 for further details.
